          <td data-label="Good fit when">You like designing proposals</td>
          <td data-label="Check first">Tools and handover process</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Route"><strong>Channel or distributor support</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good fit when">You like partners and networks</td>
          <td data-label="Check first">Territory and support given</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Route"><strong>Customer success for technical products</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good fit when">You like long term relationships</td>
          <td data-label="Check first">Metrics and customer mix</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="tsroutesb">A check before you act</h2>

  <p>
    Follow the ten percent rule of household income for education and aim for a caution limit of twenty percent. Example figures are an illustration, not a real fee.
  </p>
