  <h2 id="tsdemo">Planning a product demonstration</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Step</th>
          <th>Do</th>
          <th>Check</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Learn the buyer problem</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Ask what they struggle with today</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Write it in their words</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Pick two features that solve it</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Skip the rest</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Does each feature map to a problem?</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Prepare a short demo</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Keep it under fifteen minutes</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Rehearse with a friend</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Handle questions</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Say you will confirm what you do not know</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Follow up in writing</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Agree next step</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Trial, quote or visit</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Write the date</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Customers remember clear problem solving more than long feature lists.
  </p>
  <p>
    Record yourself once and watch it with the sound on.
  </p>

  <h2 id="tspain">Common buyer questions and honest answers</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Question</th>
          <th>Good approach</th>
          <th>Avoid</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>Is it cheaper than others?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good approach">Compare total cost over the product life</td>
          <td data-label="Avoid">Quoting only the lowest price</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>Will it work with my system?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good approach">Explain tests and limits</td>
          <td data-label="Avoid">Promising what you have not checked</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>What if it breaks?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good approach">Explain service and spare arrangements</td>
          <td data-label="Avoid">Vague assurances</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>Can you give a discount?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good approach">Link any discount to volume or terms</td>
          <td data-label="Avoid">Giving it away without asking for anything</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

