        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Item"><strong>Payout timing</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Question">When is commission paid?</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Cash flow planning</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Item"><strong>Territory</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Question">Is it exclusive?</td>
